<!doctype html>
<html>
  <body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f6f6f6;">
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#f6f6f6;">
      <tr>
        <td align="center">
          <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#ffffff;margin:24px 0;padding:32px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#222222;">
            <tr>
              <td>
                <p>Hi,</p>
                <p>Your {{ app_name }} {{ plan_code }} plan payment failed 7 days ago, and your subscription is still past due. Your plan's paid limits stay paused until the payment succeeds.</p>
                <p>Update your payment method at <a href="{{ base_url | safe }}/billing">{{ base_url | safe }}/billing</a> — if the payment keeps failing, your subscription will be canceled.</p>
                <p>— The {{ app_name }} team</p>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
